              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "માંદું (mā̃dũ) goes back to a reconstructed matthara-, \"defective\", beside Sanskrit manthara, \"slow, dull\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati word, \"sick\" (CDIAL 9754)."
